### Get all airlines
GET http://localhost:8080/airlines/

### Get a specific airline by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/airlines/invalid-id

### Create a new airline
POST http://localhost:8080/airlines/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Northstar Airways",
  "iataCode": "NS",
  "icaoCode": "NST",
  "country": "United States",
  "founded": 1985,
  "headquarters": "Dallas, Texas",
  "website": "https://example.com",
  "fleetSize": 120
}

### Update an existing airline
PUT http://localhost:8080/airlines/6aca82c257ad29e70114e82e
Content-Type: application/json

{
